{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.bridge_map_general","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.bridge_map_general","kind":"theorem","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.lean#L30-L50","doc":"**Restatement of the class field, not a derivation.**\n(`conj:two-filtration-bridge-general`.) Self-conjugate cells go to\ndepth 2, chiral pairs to depth 3, at every partition.\n\nThe class field `depth_formula` *is* this statement, and the proof\nonly unfolds it, so this is a self-assuming projection: it holds for\nany context whatsoever and carries no evidence for the bridge. The\nclaim rests on `conj:two-filtration-bridge` and on matching the\ntransposing involution on `H_n(q)` with orientation reversal on\nperiods; neither is formalised. (The bar involution fixes every\n`e_λ`, so it cannot be the separating involution.) Queued for\ndemotion to a conjecture carrier (2026-11-16). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:two-filtration-bridge-general","label":"conj:two-filtration-bridge-general","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/two-filtration-bridge-general.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.depth_formula","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.depth_formula","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Chiral/self-conjugate splitting: the depth is 2 for self-conjugate and 3 for chiral. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.depth","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.depth","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Depth assigned to a partition by the bridge map (target in the\niterated-integral depth filtration). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.conj","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.lean#L23-L23","doc":"Conjugate-partition involution `λ ↦ λ'`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.PartitionIdx","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.PartitionIdx","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.lean#L21-L21","doc":"Partition index type. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.lean#L19-L19","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.TwoFiltrationBridgeContext","kind":"class","line":18,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/AlgebraicSubstrate/TwoFiltrationBridgeGeneral.lean#L18-L28","doc":"Abstract context for the `two_filtration_bridge_general` claim. ","signatureChunk":0}]}